  "description": "He looked good with his eyes closed. But with them open he looked dangerously good.  \nWhen Sohae takes in a mysterious stranger, she did’t expect a handsome man who claim that he can’t remember a single thing. What she definitely doesn’t realize is that his amnesia is a calculated choice, he’d rather play clueless than answer her endless questions.   \nCompletely fooled and brimming with determination, Sohae vows to help him get his memories back. Too bad the man she’s trying to fix might be hiding far more than his name.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \nR19: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285003266)   \nR15: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285003267)",
